OL,3,GNEWSAI struggle to put down my phone -
OL,4,Aand I am 62
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is addictive," says 62-year-old
OL,7,FTracie from West Sussex. "I spend far
OL,8,Ftoo much time on my phone.
OL,10,F"I pick it up without realising a lot
OL,11,Fof the time... and before I know it,
OL,12,FI've lost complete track of time idly
OL,13,Fscrolling."
OL,15,FTracie is one of more than 50% of
OL,16,Fadults aged over 55 who use social
OL,17,Fmedia at least once a week, according
OL,18,Fto a 2026 YouGov poll.
OL,20,F"It's an epidemic," she said. "We are
OL,21,Faddicted to the scroll."
